# Allow-list: image builds only see the Python workspace. Never the git history, local secrets (.env),
# virtualenvs, pipeline outputs, or the intentionally vulnerable demo-shop/.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!cli
!platform
!ai
**/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
